# Waterbending Lesson: draw three cards (Mox Jet, Mox Pearl, Mox Ruby), then Bot1 may waterbend {2} (CR 701.67a-b) instead of discarding: Memnite and Ornithopter are tapped for it
# and nothing is discarded, so the hand holds the two Islands left and the three drawn. Black Lotus and the Island pay the Lesson's {3}{U} first, so only the tapping pays the waterbend.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island
Memnite
Ornithopter
Waterbending Lesson
Island
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

